<article>
	<h1><span>Storefront: Product Meta Info (Software Download)</span></h1>

	<ul class="nav">
		<li><a href="#overview">Overview</a></li>
		<li><a href="#fields">Fields</a></li>
		<li><a href="#toolbar">Toolbar</a></li>
	</ul>

	<section id="overview">
		<h2><span>Overview</span></h2>

		<p>This screen holds the download options of a product of the <strong>Software Download</strong> type.
			It opens from the product's editing screen, through the link &quot;Edit type-related options (save
			product first if you updated the type)&quot;.</p>
	</section>
	<section id="fields">
		<h2><span>Fields</span></h2>

		<h3>Software download options</h3>
		<dl>
			<dt>Is EULA Required?</dt>
			<dd>A choice of No or Yes.</dd>

			<dt>EULA (if required, can be overridden on a SKU level)</dt>
			<dd>The text of the end-user license agreement, entered in a text editor. A SKU of this product can
				set its own EULA, which overrides this one.</dd>

			<dt>Total Downloads Limit</dt>
			<dd>A text field.</dd>
		</dl>

		<p>The right-hand column shows:</p>
		<dl>
			<dt>Product ID</dt>
			<dd>The identification number of the product. It cannot be changed here.</dd>

			<dt>Product</dt>
			<dd>The name of the product. It cannot be changed here.</dd>
		</dl>
	</section>
	<section id="toolbar">
		<h2><span>Toolbar</span></h2>
		<p>At the top right you will see the toolbar.</p>
		<p>The functions are:</p>
		<dl>
			<dt>Save</dt>
			<dd>Saves the options and stays on this screen.</dd>

			<dt>Save &amp; Close</dt>
			<dd>Saves the options and returns to the product's editing screen.</dd>

			<dt>Cancel</dt>
			<dd>Discards any changes and returns to the product's editing screen.</dd>

			<dt>Help</dt>
			<dd>Opens this help screen.</dd>
		</dl>
		<p>Save and Save &amp; Close only appear if you may edit products.</p>
	</section>
</article>
